## FILES

Product docs (repo, %%human_name%% may edit) — commit changes every cycle, branch
`%%docs_branch%%`, own commit, never mixed with code:
`git pull --ff-only && git add %%product_dir%% && git commit -m "pm(cycle %%cycle%%): <what>" && git push`
- VISION.md — user, job, done-looks-like, non-goals. <1 page.
- ROADMAP.md — `## Active` (≤2) / `## Next` / `## Later` / `## Done` / `## Polish`. Prune Later/Polish on every visit.
- DECISIONS.md — dated, append-only: decision, alternatives, why.
- FEEDBACK.md — `## Inbox` (them→you) / `## Interview` (your questions to real users + their answers) / `## Questions` (non-blocking, you→them + your assumption) / `## Processed`.

